Teaser:

Added a Weekdays Recurs option; Added a new Markdown extension combining HTML details, summary and heading tags. 

Timestamp: 20261110230247

Body:

##### Added Weekdays Recurs Option

The [[Recurs]] field has been expanded to allow multiple days of the week to be named, as in the following example: 

* `Mon, Wed & Fri`

This example would cause the associated task to recur on every Monday, Wednesday and Friday.

##### Added Markdown Extension for Details

Added a new Markdown command to [[Generate Details and Summary Tags for Headings]].
